-- Ten more yachts (photos copied from the ryc-rentals photo store into web/public/fleet). Specs are manufacturer figures; charter prices are the lowest weekly list price seen for the model in Türkiye.
on conflict (slug) do update set sort = excluded.sort, model = excluded.model, year = excluded.year, length_m = excluded.length_m, beam_m = excluded.beam_m, draft_m = excluded.draft_m, cabins = excluded.cabins, berths = excluded.berths, heads = excluded.heads, engine_hp = excluded.engine_hp, base = excluded.base, used_for = excluded.used_for, charter_from_eur = excluded.charter_from_eur, photo_id = excluded.photo_id, photo_alt = excluded.photo_alt, description = excluded.description;
